      "contentTypeContains": ["xml", "soap"],
      "note": "XML External Entity injection probes for local file disclosure or SSRF. Surfaced on endpoints whose Content-Type carries XML/SOAP -- inject inside the body's DOCTYPE. Also worth trying on SVG file uploads (parsed as XML by many image libraries) and XML-RPC endpoints (e.g. xmlrpc.php).",
